              "7m2jV7BOFkA@541"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch06.s11.p03.04",
            "text": "For the prompt asking to rewrite a sentence using a simile, the correct response is \"the car is as fast as lightning,\" while the model response \"the car is as fast as a bullet\" is very close.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "7m2jV7BOFkA@553",
