              "7m2jV7BOFkA@580"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch06.s11.p03.05",
            "text": "For the question asking which cloud type is associated with thunderstorms, the model response is not good because it does not provide the requested cloud type.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
