            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch06.s11.p03.06",
            "text": "For the question about the author of Pride and Prejudice, the correct response is Jane Austen, but the model answered \"George Bernard Shaw,\" which is clearly wrong.",
            "type": "F",
